! <solver:p610_t3>
! Smooth 2-stage CIRCULAR tunnel excavation (Mohr-Coulomb, T3 plane-strain).
!
!   Tunnel  : circular cavity at the origin, radius 1 m, 24-gon approximation
!             (15 deg between boundary nodes).
!   Domain  : circular outer boundary at r = 3 m, fully clamped.
!   Mesh    : 120 T3 elements, 73 nodes  (5x the coarse octagonal demo).
!               *  24 inner disc triangles meeting at the tunnel centre   -> excavated
!               *  48 outer-ring triangles between r = 1 and r = 2 m     -> kept
!               *  48 outer-ring triangles between r = 2 and r = 3 m     -> kept
!
!   Stage 1 (top heading): elements  1..12   (theta = 0 deg ... 180 deg)
!   Stage 2 (bench):       elements 13..24   (theta = 180 deg ... 360 deg)
!
!   Node numbering (1-based):
!         1            tunnel centre (0, 0)
!         2 .. 25      inner ring r = 1 m   (theta_i = i * 15 deg)
!        26 .. 49      middle ring r = 2 m
!        50 .. 73      outer ring r = 3 m   (clamped)
!
!   Annular triangulation per CCW cell (a=inner_k, d=outer_k, c=outer_(k+1), b=inner_(k+1)):
!     T1 = (a, d, c)    T2 = (a, c, b)    -- both CCW (positive Jacobian).
!
